      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "2. The petitioner is an accused in S.C. Case No.34/14 of 2021, pending in the file of learned Additional Sessions Judge, Sonepur, arising out of Sonepur P.S. Case No.13 of 2021, offence under Sections 376(D)/341/506 of IPC.\n3.",
