          "end": 751
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 752,
          "end": 759
        },
        {
          "text": "Additional Sessions Judge, Sonepur",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 775,
          "end": 809
        },
        {
          "text": "13.09.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 825,
          "end": 835
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the Petitioner submits that by order dated 15.09.2022 in BLAPL No.8344 of 2022, taking into account that the Petitioner is in custody since 21.10.2021, learned trial Court was asked to conclude the trial within a period of three months from the date of receipt/production of the certified copy of the said order.\n5. It is the submission of the learned counsel for the Petitioner, on instruction that in spite of production of this order before the learned Court in seisin, the trial has not been concluded.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 898,
      "end": 1428,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "15.09.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 965,
          "end": 975
        },
        {
          "text": "BLAPL No.8344 of 2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 979,
          "end": 1000
        },
        {
          "text": "21.10.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1062,
          "end": 1072
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Hence,\nhe seeks release.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1429,
      "end": 1453,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "6. On perusal of the impugned order dated 13.09.2023, it is not borne out that the earlier order of this Court adverted to hereinabove was brought to the notice of the Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1455,
