      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "7. Call for a report from the learned Court in seisin as to whether the order of this Court in BLAPL No.8344 of 2022 fixing the time frame for conclusion was placed before the Court and if so, whether any extension has been sought for to conclude the trial and if not, the reason for not seeking such extension and the reason for delay in disposal of the case and the time frame within the same can be concluded.\n8. List this matter on 24.11.2023 along with such report.\n9. Registry is requested to do the needful.",
